(Rich laughing)

271
00:09:01.426 --> 00:09:02.627
because he wouldn't like it.

272
00:09:02.627 --> 00:09:06.479
But I mean, I think no, well, yes, pun intended,

273
00:09:06.479 --> 00:09:08.140
the wheels would've to come off for him

274
00:09:08.140 --> 00:09:09.961
to not break-
To not break it.

275
00:09:09.961 --> 00:09:11.388
Right, 'cause he's just,

276
00:09:11.388 --> 00:09:12.720
you know, he won the,

277
00:09:12.720 --> 00:09:14.303
he won Kona and the

278
00:09:15.492 --> 00:09:17.839
hand cycle division a couple of years ago,

279
00:09:17.839 --> 00:09:19.637
not this past year, but the year before.

280
00:09:19.637 --> 00:09:21.400
And he's just a,

281
00:09:21.400 --> 00:09:22.817
he's a tough guy.

282
00:09:25.995 --> 00:09:27.784
His story is amazing.

283
00:09:27.784 --> 00:09:29.028
You know, he lost,

