312
00:10:42.591 --> 00:10:43.424
No, no.

313
00:10:43.424 --> 00:10:44.257
Why is that?

314
00:10:44.257 --> 00:10:46.578
Why is he handicapping himself further?

315
00:10:46.578 --> 00:10:48.228
I think it's a message in a way.

316
00:10:48.228 --> 00:10:49.292
I mean, he wants to,

317
00:10:49.292 --> 00:10:50.410
he wants to say,

318
00:10:50.410 --> 00:10:52.961
'cause he is these racing wheelchairs are really expensive

319
00:10:52.961 --> 00:10:55.702
and there's a lot of folks out there who are in wheelchairs.

320
00:10:55.702 --> 00:10:58.152
And the idea that you can't have exercise

321
00:10:58.152 --> 00:11:00.839
is that you can't be active,

322
00:11:00.839 --> 00:11:03.971
because of that is something that he

323
00:11:03.971 --> 00:11:05.668
feels very strongly is not the case.

324
00:11:05.668 --> 00:11:09.084
And so, you know, he'll have to make some modifications

325
00:11:09.084 --> 00:11:12.107
and it may not be, you know, fully stock,

326
00:11:12.107 --> 00:11:14.978
but it will certainly be as close to it as he can make it.

327
00:11:14.978 --> 00:11:16.183
Wow, that's amazing.

328
00:11:16.183 --> 00:11:18.044
And just, you know, in case people

329
00:11:18.044 --> 00:11:22.371
are not comprehending what we're talking about here,

330
00:11:22.371 --> 00:11:24.066
the intention is to,

331
00:11:24.066 --> 00:11:25.468
you're basically gonna have to cover about

332
00:11:25.468 --> 00:11:27.398
70 miles every single day

333
00:11:27.398 --> 00:11:30.178
in order to cross the country in 44 days

334
00:11:30.178 --> 00:11:33.234
and that's running or wheelchairing,

335
00:11:33.234 --> 00:11:38.105
rolling 70 miles every single day without any rest day.

336
00:11:38.105 --> 00:11:41.942
So how do you even begin to approach that,

337
00:11:41.942 --> 00:11:44.692
