338
00:11:45.556 --> 00:11:46.995
(Rich laughing)
(Charlie laughing)

339
00:11:46.995 --> 00:11:48.512
Yeah, I mean.

340
00:11:48.512 --> 00:11:50.683
Those people that know me know that the mental part of it

341
00:11:50.683 --> 00:11:53.171
is that that is the big question question.

342
00:11:53.171 --> 00:11:54.295
And it may just be that

343
00:11:54.295 --> 00:11:55.807
I don't have enough going on up there

344
00:11:55.807 --> 00:11:57.782
to really think about it.

345
00:11:57.782 --> 00:11:59.095
Right, I mean to backtrack

346
00:11:59.095 --> 00:12:01.927
