387
00:13:30.907 --> 00:13:33.918
This time I have a partner in Andre,

388
00:13:33.918 --> 00:13:38.691
who is equal in his approach to the way we're doing this.

389
00:13:38.691 --> 00:13:40.648
And he is taking on, you know,

