00:13:40.648 --> 00:13:43.811
a lot of the planning and logistical tasks.

391
00:13:43.811 --> 00:13:46.937
And in 2008, I was left to do those myself,

392
00:13:46.937 --> 00:13:49.165
and I also over trained.

393
00:13:49.165 --> 00:13:50.871
I made the mistake that I tell other people-

394
00:13:50.871 --> 00:13:51.704
Right.

395
00:13:51.704 --> 00:13:54.200
Don't do all the time.

396
00:13:54.200 --> 00:13:55.033
I was just-

