00:14:04.142 --> 00:14:05.456
(Rich laughing)

402
00:14:05.456 --> 00:14:06.439
when I'm crossing the country.

403
00:14:06.439 --> 00:14:07.272
Yeah.

404
00:14:07.272 --> 00:14:08.230
500 miles a week-
Wow.

405
00:14:08.230 --> 00:14:10.047
And that's for six weeks in a row.

406
00:14:10.047 --> 00:14:12.697
And that is an absurd,

407
00:14:12.697 --> 00:14:15.239
if I actually think about that,

