00:14:15.239 --> 00:14:19.409
I would recognize that it's simply not possible.

409
00:14:19.409 --> 00:14:20.455
I mean, and-

410
00:14:20.455 --> 00:14:21.857
So it's back to the moment.

411
00:14:21.857 --> 00:14:22.757
It's back to the moment.

412
00:14:22.757 --> 00:14:24.508
Being in the present moment and being in the now.

