451
00:15:56.942 --> 00:15:57.974
where I can actually cover

452
00:15:57.974 --> 00:16:00.891
70 miles a day in 15 hours or less,

453
00:16:03.455 --> 00:16:05.770
get, you know, some time to eat,

454
00:16:05.770 --> 00:16:06.792
get a quick massage

455
00:16:06.792 --> 00:16:10.825
and hopefully get a minimum of seven hours of sleep.

456
00:16:10.825 --> 00:16:12.116
Can you help me?

457
00:16:12.116 --> 00:16:14.282
And he absolutely stepped up

458
00:16:14.282 --> 00:16:16.940
and said that he thought he had a plan for me.

459
00:16:16.940 --> 00:16:18.812
And he has given that to me,

460
00:16:18.812 --> 00:16:20.766
