461
00:16:20.766 --> 00:16:24.599
And it's very strange as a runner sometimes to

462
00:16:25.578 --> 00:16:27.084
walk, you know-
Right.

463
00:16:27.084 --> 00:16:28.456
To sort of fast hike,

464
00:16:28.456 --> 00:16:29.961
which I actually do pretty well,

465
00:16:29.961 --> 00:16:33.584
