00:16:33.584 --> 00:16:35.584
is to get to the finish.

467
00:16:36.589 --> 00:16:38.796
I mean, it seems counterintuitive.

468
00:16:38.796 --> 00:16:42.166
And yet at the same time, it seems completely elementary.

469
00:16:42.166 --> 00:16:45.514
If you just have to cover those 70 miles,

470
00:16:45.514 --> 00:16:47.824
between when you wake up in the morning

471
00:16:47.824 --> 00:16:49.699
