00:29:02.503 --> 00:29:05.110
I was 20 years younger, not surprisingly.

801
00:29:05.110 --> 00:29:06.481
Funny how that works.

802
00:29:06.481 --> 00:29:09.870
And all I cared about was going fast.

803
00:29:09.870 --> 00:29:12.125
I wanted to break three hours at Boston,

