00:29:12.125 --> 00:29:13.848
and, you know, and I did.

805
00:29:13.848 --> 00:29:15.327
And like, that was my big goal.

806
00:29:15.327 --> 00:29:19.066
And then the next time I found that,

807
00:29:19.066 --> 00:29:21.476
I'm like, wow, there's a lot of cute girls at Wellesley.

808
00:29:21.476 --> 00:29:22.309
I should stop,
(Rich laughing)

809
00:29:22.309 --> 00:29:24.047
and at least acknowledge them, you know?

810
00:29:24.047 --> 00:29:26.044
And then the next time it was like,

811
00:29:26.044 --> 00:29:27.519
well, there's a bunch of kids out here

812
00:29:27.519 --> 00:29:29.198
that are handing out orange slices.

813
00:29:29.198 --> 00:29:31.344
I should take those and high five them.

814
00:29:31.344 --> 00:29:33.388
And so, you know, my times-

815
00:29:33.388 --> 00:29:34.734
Becomes more about the experience.

816
00:29:34.734 --> 00:29:35.567
Yeah, my times has changed,

817
00:29:35.567 --> 00:29:37.390
and the point being that I changed,

818
00:29:37.390 --> 00:29:38.317
Boston didn't change.

819
00:29:38.317 --> 00:29:42.754
That marathon course is exactly the same every time.

