00:29:57.041 --> 00:30:00.609
but we, of course, and me in this case,

825
00:30:00.609 --> 00:30:02.080
you know, I've changed.

826
00:30:02.080 --> 00:30:04.711
And that's a cool thing to sort of acknowledge

827
00:30:04.711 --> 00:30:07.468
when you're running on a course like that.

828
00:30:07.468 --> 00:30:09.500
Yeah, and I think it's

829
00:30:09.500 --> 00:30:12.551
kind of incumbent upon someone like yourself

830
00:30:12.551 --> 00:30:14.942
that if you're gonna undertake a race or an adventure,

