00:30:19.837 --> 00:30:21.145
Like, oh, I'm gonna run across the US

834
00:30:21.145 --> 00:30:22.532
while other people have done that,

835
00:30:22.532 --> 00:30:24.070
other people have done it faster.

836
00:30:24.070 --> 00:30:26.910
I'm gonna try to be the fastest,

837
00:30:26.910 --> 00:30:28.841
but you know, why are you doing,

838
00:30:28.841 --> 00:30:31.037
like what is driving you to do?

839
00:30:31.037 --> 00:30:34.706
What is the undercurrent that is creating this compulsion

840
00:30:34.706 --> 00:30:37.705
to show up for this kind of adventure?

841
00:30:37.705 --> 00:30:39.940
And I'm sure, you know,

842
00:30:39.940 --> 00:30:41.790
there's many reasons for that internally.

843
00:30:41.790 --> 00:30:42.727
(Rich laughing)

844
00:30:42.727 --> 00:30:44.203
Maybe your therapist knows-
Yeah.

845
00:30:44.203 --> 00:30:46.786
A little bit about that,

846
00:30:46.786 --> 00:30:48.717
or your sponsor, but, you know,

847
00:30:48.717 --> 00:30:50.940
but to tie it to something bigger than yourself,

848
00:30:50.940 --> 00:30:53.906
like this cause of Boston and you have to do that.

849
00:30:53.906 --> 00:30:57.661
Well, you can, and again, my answers change and it's not,

850
00:30:57.661 --> 00:31:01.452
it is because I, hopefully, I'm morph and change

851
00:31:01.452 --> 00:31:04.321
and, you know, I'm really,

852
00:31:04.321 --> 00:31:05.821
I like to say that

853
00:31:07.816 --> 00:31:09.376
these types of adventures,

854
00:31:09.376 --> 00:31:11.459
these long, very painful,

855
00:31:12.466 --> 00:31:16.239
they're not things that I don't think they're good for me,

856
00:31:16.239 --> 00:31:17.224
like healthy.

857
00:31:17.224 --> 00:31:18.845
I don't people have said, is this,

858
00:31:18.845 --> 00:31:21.238
how do you feel about what is doing to your body?

859
00:31:21.238 --> 00:31:23.146
I'm like, it can't be good for me,

860
00:31:23.146 --> 00:31:24.377
and I'm not,

861
00:31:24.377 --> 00:31:25.791
I'm not the one saying that it,

862
00:31:25.791 --> 00:31:27.262
that it is,

863
00:31:27.262 --> 00:31:29.727
however, it is something I am compelled to do.

864
00:31:29.727 --> 00:31:31.882
And it is probably,

865
00:31:31.882 --> 00:31:34.261
I don't know probably, it's related certainly

866
00:31:34.261 --> 00:31:36.094
to my addictive nature

867
00:31:37.378 --> 00:31:41.751
and certainly an obsessive personality to a degree.

868
00:31:41.751 --> 00:31:45.774
And my lifelong goal has been finding balance

869
00:31:45.774 --> 00:31:47.774
and marrying Astacianna,

870
00:31:48.753 --> 00:31:51.317
who is a much more balanced person than I am,

871
00:31:51.317 --> 00:31:52.567
is part of the,

872
00:31:54.018 --> 00:31:57.087
is part of what I think that the growth

873
00:31:57.087 --> 00:32:00.471
that I've been able to experience over these last few years,

874
00:32:00.471 --> 00:32:02.433
where a lot of things have happened to me.

875
00:32:02.433 --> 00:32:05.222
I've gone through a lot.

876
00:32:05.222 --> 00:32:06.610
Well, I'm fond of saying,

877
00:32:06.610 --> 00:32:07.852
