880
00:32:12.073 --> 00:32:15.757
Because the likelihood of completing this Run2Boston

881
00:32:15.757 --> 00:32:18.119
and breaking this record,

882
00:32:18.119 --> 00:32:19.647
it's not like I'm sitting here saying,

883
00:32:19.647 --> 00:32:22.210
"Oh yeah, I'm gonna do that."

884
00:32:22.210 --> 00:32:24.489
And it's not about playing the mental game

885
00:32:24.489 --> 00:32:26.378
we sometimes do with ourselves

886
00:32:26.378 --> 00:32:30.228
where we feel like confidence is going to overcome it.

887
00:32:30.228 --> 00:32:32.053
This is too, it's too big.

888
00:32:32.053 --> 00:32:33.662
It's too difficult for that.

889
00:32:33.662 --> 00:32:38.662
And so humbly I say that I am going to give it my best shot

890
00:32:39.036 --> 00:32:42.286
and that I hope that I learned some

891
00:32:42.286 --> 00:32:44.186
more things about myself along the way,

892
00:32:44.186 --> 00:32:47.730
