893
00:32:47.730 --> 00:32:52.029
both in Boston and in other ways and about sobriety.

894
00:32:52.029 --> 00:32:54.812
And we've got some great charitable partners

895
00:32:54.812 --> 00:32:59.740
that are coming on board and really just make it a,

896
00:32:59.740 --> 00:33:02.781
make it an experience that somehow

897
00:33:02.781 --> 00:33:05.987
helps me get along further and be,

898
00:33:05.987 --> 00:33:07.802
you know, be better in general.

899
00:33:07.802 --> 00:33:10.424
Again, back to this theme of showing up

900
00:33:10.424 --> 00:33:12.452
and being in the moment, right?

901
00:33:12.452 --> 00:33:13.293
I don't wanna be afraid,

902
00:33:13.293 --> 00:33:14.509
I am afraid of it.

903
00:33:14.509 --> 00:33:15.342
I am afraid,

904
00:33:15.342 --> 00:33:16.794
you know what I'm afraid of?

905
00:33:16.794 --> 00:33:18.951
I'm afraid that three days into this thing,

906
00:33:18.951 --> 00:33:20.057
let's see, I shouldn't even pick a day,

907
00:33:20.057 --> 00:33:21.005
'cause that makes me nervous.

908
00:33:21.005 --> 00:33:21.838
Yeah.
(Rich laughing)

909
00:33:21.838 --> 00:33:23.629
Some, you know, a few days into this thing

910
00:33:23.629 --> 00:33:25.603
that like, you know, I'm gonna,

911
00:33:25.603 --> 00:33:27.251
something's gonna happen and I can't go on.

912
00:33:27.251 --> 00:33:29.334
And it's like, I tend to,

913
00:33:31.781 --> 00:33:35.555
my successes have been pretty broadly watched,

914
00:33:35.555 --> 00:33:38.062
and my failures-
Right.

915
00:33:38.062 --> 00:33:39.375
Both as a human being

916
00:33:39.375 --> 00:33:43.176
and as an athlete have also been pretty,

917
00:33:43.176 --> 00:33:46.687
pretty easily viewed by anyone that wants to take the time

918
00:33:46.687 --> 00:33:47.520
and all-

919
00:33:47.520 --> 00:33:48.408
Yeah, but you're like,

920
00:33:48.408 --> 00:33:51.812
it's almost like in the world according to Garp,

921
00:33:51.812 --> 00:33:54.023
when the airplane crashes into the house and he says,

922
00:33:54.023 --> 00:33:54.856
I'll buy it.

923
00:33:54.856 --> 00:33:55.842
It's pre-disasterious, right?
(Charlie laughing)

924
00:33:55.842 --> 00:33:56.811
It's never gonna happen again.

925
00:33:56.811 --> 00:33:58.890
So you've had these epic fails,

926
00:33:58.890 --> 00:34:02.723
you've experienced incredible lows in your life.

927
00:34:02.723 --> 00:34:04.722
So the idea of showing up and running across the country

928
00:34:04.722 --> 00:34:06.486
and not making it, it's like, eh.

929
00:34:06.486 --> 00:34:07.319
Yeah.

930
00:34:07.319 --> 00:34:08.305
You know, like I was in jail, you know?

931
00:34:08.305 --> 00:34:09.138
Yeah.

932
00:34:09.138 --> 00:34:10.199
I was a crack addict.
Yeah.

933
00:34:10.199 --> 00:34:11.032
Like what is that?

934
00:34:11.032 --> 00:34:11.865
Who care?

935
00:34:11.865 --> 00:34:12.698
You know what I mean?

936
00:34:12.698 --> 00:34:14.312
