00:34:16.905 --> 00:34:20.488
but in terms of perspective and proportion.

939
00:34:21.346 --> 00:34:22.179
Well,

940
00:34:22.179 --> 00:34:23.413
we all think that everyone's watching us too.

941
00:34:23.413 --> 00:34:24.246
Yeah.

942
00:34:24.246 --> 00:34:25.339
Like that somehow what we are doing,

943
00:34:25.339 --> 00:34:26.172
(Rich laughing)

944
00:34:26.172 --> 00:34:27.730
even if you're just a, you know, no matter-

