00:34:27.730 --> 00:34:29.586
That's a self-obsession of the alcoholic mind.

946
00:34:29.586 --> 00:34:30.419
(Charlie laughing)

947
00:34:30.419 --> 00:34:31.252
Right.

948
00:34:31.252 --> 00:34:32.107
Everybody in the world cares.

949
00:34:32.107 --> 00:34:32.940
Yeah.

950
00:34:32.940 --> 00:34:34.848
About whether or not I succeed at this.

951
00:34:34.848 --> 00:34:35.681
Yeah.

952
00:34:35.681 --> 00:34:36.514
And the reality is-

