00:34:36.514 --> 00:34:37.891
And at the same time everybody hates me.

954
00:34:37.891 --> 00:34:38.724
Right.
Yeah.

955
00:34:38.724 --> 00:34:40.527
And that may be true,

956
00:34:40.527 --> 00:34:41.860
(Rich laughing)
but you know,

957
00:34:41.860 --> 00:34:44.011
it's certainly not true that every,

958
00:34:44.011 --> 00:34:47.428
nobody else's life is like hanging on

