00:36:00.978 --> 00:36:02.659
and I don't deny that I am sometimes.

996
00:36:02.659 --> 00:36:03.492
Yeah.
(Rich laughing)

997
00:36:03.492 --> 00:36:05.181
I mean, the thing is that I think

