00:36:10.189 --> 00:36:12.439
I am not an easy person to,

1001
00:36:14.015 --> 00:36:15.526
you know, to be around sometimes.

1002
00:36:15.526 --> 00:36:16.824
I'm not fair.

1003
00:36:16.824 --> 00:36:21.824
I'm driven in ways that are occasionally embarrassing to me.

1004
00:36:23.548 --> 00:36:27.453
But certainly as a human being that I,

1005
00:36:27.453 --> 00:36:29.501
