00:37:06.156 --> 00:37:09.960
and printed and talked about out there about how,

1018
00:37:09.960 --> 00:37:13.210
how unfair it was and how wrong it was.

1019
00:37:15.454 --> 00:37:17.361
I didn't need to say a thing.

1020
00:37:17.361 --> 00:37:18.645
Right.

1021
00:37:18.645 --> 00:37:20.141
And I want to get into that,

1022
00:37:20.141 --> 00:37:22.270
into that part of the story a little bit,

1023
00:37:22.270 --> 00:37:23.961
but to kind of backtrack.

1024
00:37:23.961 --> 00:37:24.912
I mean, I first,

