00:37:24.912 --> 00:37:26.497
the first time I heard an interview with you,

1026
00:37:26.497 --> 00:37:29.330
it must have been like 2007 maybe,

1027
00:37:31.394 --> 00:37:33.904
it was before I'd ever done any of this stuff,

1028
00:37:33.904 --> 00:37:36.495
any of the Ultraman kind of things.

1029
00:37:36.495 --> 00:37:37.572
And I think it was,

