00:37:54.018 --> 00:37:57.179
you've just transferred your addiction onto your running.

1037
00:37:57.179 --> 00:37:59.762
And what do you say to somebody

1038
00:38:01.071 --> 00:38:02.221
who accuses you of that?

1039
00:38:02.221 --> 00:38:03.054
And you had a really,

1040
00:38:03.054 --> 00:38:04.034
I don't know if you remember,

1041
00:38:04.034 --> 00:38:07.074
but you had a really fascinating answer to that question

1042
00:38:07.074 --> 00:38:08.736
that really stuck with me

1043
00:38:08.736 --> 00:38:10.581
because it's something that I struggle with.

1044
00:38:10.581 --> 00:38:12.734
And I feel that same question all the time.

1045
00:38:12.734 --> 00:38:14.335
Do you remember what you said?

1046
00:38:14.335 --> 00:38:15.286
I know what I would say now,

1047
00:38:15.286 --> 00:38:16.119
so no, I don't-

1048
00:38:16.119 --> 00:38:18.298
I'm interested in what say

