00:38:18.298 --> 00:38:21.485
What I would say now is,

1050
00:38:21.485 --> 00:38:26.135
is that drugs and alcohol absolutely masked everything

1051
00:38:26.135 --> 00:38:29.757
that I ever was, no matter what that was.

1052
00:38:29.757 --> 00:38:31.535
It was a mask.

