00:38:49.184 --> 00:38:51.058
eventually during a 100 miles,

1058
00:38:51.058 --> 00:38:54.264
you will become exactly who you are,

1059
00:38:54.264 --> 00:38:55.861
for better or for worse.

1060
00:38:55.861 --> 00:38:59.344
That's not always the best thing so,

1061
00:38:59.344 --> 00:39:01.392
