1602
00:58:47.575 --> 00:58:49.604
and that's something that I think you did in spades,

1603
00:58:49.604 --> 00:58:52.432
you know, in terms of your,

1604
00:58:52.432 --> 00:58:53.577
your prison sentence,

1605
00:58:53.577 --> 00:58:54.410
your jail sentence.

1606
00:58:54.410 --> 00:58:56.956
I mean, I've been following on Twitter for a long time,

1607
00:58:56.956 --> 00:58:58.206
and I remember,

1608
00:58:59.943 --> 00:59:01.767
you would send out these tweets and I'm thinking,

1609
00:59:01.767 --> 00:59:03.842
is he allowed to tweet from jail?

1610
00:59:03.842 --> 00:59:05.540
Or is his son doing it for him?

1611
00:59:05.540 --> 00:59:06.373
Like, how is this even,

1612
00:59:06.373 --> 00:59:08.298
I'm like fascinated by the like the,

1613
00:59:08.298 --> 00:59:10.719
just the pure logistics of how that happened,

1614
00:59:10.719 --> 00:59:15.209
but persistently putting out this positive message,

1615
00:59:15.209 --> 00:59:19.792
this refusal to allow this experience to control you

1616
00:59:19.792 --> 00:59:23.130
or to lapse into some kind of victimhood

1617
00:59:23.130 --> 00:59:25.583
and then to read subsequently

1618
00:59:25.583 --> 00:59:28.715
or during the latter stages of your tenure there,

1619
00:59:28.715 --> 00:59:31.366
the impact that you're having on your fellow inmates

1620
00:59:31.366 --> 00:59:33.163
and these guys that are starting to run

1621
00:59:33.163 --> 00:59:35.061
and are losing tremendous amounts of weight

1622
00:59:35.061 --> 00:59:38.411
