1630
00:59:57.148 --> 00:59:58.263
Yeah.
(Rich chuckling)

1631
00:59:58.263 --> 00:59:59.587
They've been a great way to get my ass kicked.

1632
00:59:59.587 --> 01:00:00.698
It gets shanked.
Right.

1633
01:00:00.698 --> 01:00:01.533
