01:01:26.400 --> 01:01:29.983
if they completed this very long nine month

1676
01:01:31.071 --> 01:01:33.310
drug education program.
Right.

1677
01:01:33.310 --> 01:01:34.892
But basically the,

1678
01:01:34.892 --> 01:01:36.011
and I'm sure the,

1679
01:01:36.011 --> 01:01:37.303
I'm sure the prison

1680
01:01:37.303 --> 01:01:39.662
and the program would argue with this viewpoint.

1681
01:01:39.662 --> 01:01:43.305
My viewpoint was that the program basically said,

1682
01:01:43.305 --> 01:01:46.192
you're bad, you have destroyed your family,

1683
01:01:46.192 --> 01:01:48.595
you've destroyed your lives.

1684
01:01:48.595 --> 01:01:49.757
Don't do drugs.

1685
01:01:49.757 --> 01:01:51.146
Like that was the extent-
Right.

1686
01:01:51.146 --> 01:01:53.094
Of the education, you know?

1687
01:01:53.094 --> 01:01:55.054
So it wasn't really recovery oriented.

1688
01:01:55.054 --> 01:01:55.887
No.

1689
01:01:55.887 --> 01:01:56.720
It wasn't more of a

1690
01:01:56.720 --> 01:01:57.958
sort of a nine month shaming process.

1691
01:01:57.958 --> 01:01:58.936
No, you're a piece of shit.

1692
01:01:58.936 --> 01:01:59.769
(Rich laughing)

1693
01:01:59.769 --> 01:02:02.534
Don't do drugs, you know, and so stop doing that.

1694
01:02:02.534 --> 01:02:05.013
And while a lot of people would probably think

1695
01:02:05.013 --> 01:02:06.802
that's a good approach, somehow-

1696
01:02:06.802 --> 01:02:07.677
It's the Nancy Reagan.

1697
01:02:07.677 --> 01:02:09.259
Yeah.
Just say no approach.

1698
01:02:09.259 --> 01:02:10.447
The fact is that can be,

1699
01:02:10.447 --> 01:02:11.496
that's all well and good.

1700
