People can be, you know, feel strongly

1701
01:02:14.643 --> 01:02:17.385
about how they view people

1702
01:02:17.385 --> 01:02:19.717
who do drugs or have gotten in trouble

1703
01:02:19.717 --> 01:02:21.500
with the law for doing drugs.

1704
01:02:21.500 --> 01:02:25.011
But the reality is if the goal is to actually

1705
01:02:25.011 --> 01:02:27.911
turn out people when they come out of prison,

1706
01:02:27.911 --> 01:02:31.564
who are better than when they went in

1707
01:02:31.564 --> 01:02:34.885
and more likely to make a contribution to society,

1708
01:02:34.885 --> 01:02:38.101
then shaming them is certainly not the way,

1709
01:02:38.101 --> 01:02:39.086
to do it.

1710
01:02:39.086 --> 01:02:42.596
And very little is spent on treatment as we all know.

1711
01:02:42.596 --> 01:02:45.050
I mean, it's been proven time and again,

1712
01:02:45.050 --> 01:02:48.973
that every dollar that's spent on prevention

1713
01:02:48.973 --> 01:02:50.290
will come back tenfold,

1714
01:02:50.290 --> 01:02:52.352
whereas, you know, every,

1715
01:02:52.352 --> 01:02:54.511
every dollar that's spent on incarceration

1716
01:02:54.511 --> 01:02:57.457
and on sending these guys, that's why,

1717
01:02:57.457 --> 01:02:58.702
you know, it's another reason, Rich,

1718
01:02:58.702 --> 01:03:00.500
that I never, I really,

1719
01:03:00.500 --> 01:03:04.460
it would be embarrassing to me to complain about

1720
01:03:04.460 --> 01:03:08.075
my plight and how I might have felt about how,

1721
01:03:08.075 --> 01:03:09.957
how that all happened to me.

1722
01:03:09.957 --> 01:03:12.570
When I'm in there with guys, African American guys,

1723
01:03:12.570 --> 01:03:14.805
who got 20 year sentences

1724
01:03:14.805 --> 01:03:19.055
for a small handful of crack that I had in my hand,

1725
01:03:20.053 --> 01:03:21.026
tons of times.

1726
01:03:21.026 --> 01:03:24.691
And if I had been a Black man in this country,

1727
01:03:24.691 --> 01:03:25.937
in those times,

1728
01:03:25.937 --> 01:03:28.750
I would've been stopped driving the car that I would've,

1729
01:03:28.750 --> 01:03:29.862
