1730
01:03:29.862 --> 01:03:30.695
Right.

1731
01:03:30.695 --> 01:03:32.221
Which was just a Toyota 4Runner,

1732
01:03:32.221 --> 01:03:33.163
it's not like it was fancy,

1733
