but I would've been stopped.

1734
01:03:34.611 --> 01:03:35.444
They would've searched me.

1735
01:03:35.444 --> 01:03:36.403
They would've found that.

1736
01:03:36.403 --> 01:03:38.419
And I would've been the guy getting 20 years,

1737
01:03:38.419 --> 01:03:39.847
but I wasn't that guy.

1738
01:03:39.847 --> 01:03:43.316
I was the white guy driving the car in the hood

1739
01:03:43.316 --> 01:03:44.245
that for whatever reason,

1740
01:03:44.245 --> 01:03:46.745
just never that didn't happen.

1741
01:03:48.582 --> 01:03:49.874
I knew that,

1742
01:03:49.874 --> 01:03:53.313
it would've been embarrassing to me

1743
01:03:53.313 --> 01:03:57.879
being in their next to guys who really had their lives,

1744
01:03:57.879 --> 01:04:01.906
their whole lives taken away from them.

1745
01:04:01.906 --> 01:04:04.897
And actually the sentencing and the Congress

1746
