were very possibly the most

1749
01:04:17.259 --> 01:04:22.094
unfavorable and really unforgivable sentencing guideline

1750
01:04:22.094 --> 01:04:24.401
ever handed down in any country.

1751
01:04:24.401 --> 01:04:26.939
And so there are some changes being made

1752
01:04:26.939 --> 01:04:28.290
to those guidelines now,

1753
01:04:28.290 --> 01:04:29.915
and acknowledgement that that was wrong.

1754
01:04:29.915 --> 01:04:30.748
But anyway, my-
Yeah, I mean-

1755
01:04:30.748 --> 01:04:32.304
My point of all that is I would,

1756
01:04:32.304 --> 01:04:34.524
I would've felt like a total idiot.

1757
01:04:34.524 --> 01:04:35.913
Yeah, but you're also a human being,

1758
01:04:35.913 --> 01:04:37.104
who's been incarcerated

1759
01:04:37.104 --> 01:04:40.220
