01:04:46.209 --> 01:04:48.299
a luxury we can,

1763
01:04:48.299 --> 01:04:49.964
we cannot afford,

1764
01:04:49.964 --> 01:04:52.739
but that's a stupid little-

1765
01:04:52.739 --> 01:04:53.572
Yeah.

1766
01:04:53.572 --> 01:04:55.131
Annoying saying,

1767
01:04:55.131 --> 01:04:58.381
and to be able to actually embody that.

1768
01:04:59.339 --> 01:05:02.278
And when you're in the scenario that you were in,

1769
01:05:02.278 --> 01:05:04.113
I mean is no small feat.

1770
01:05:04.113 --> 01:05:05.191
Well, I knew very quickly.

1771
01:05:05.191 --> 01:05:07.122
And even after I got arrested,

1772
01:05:07.122 --> 01:05:10.644
