01:05:31.070 --> 01:05:33.600
I mean, essentially your,

1787
01:05:33.600 --> 01:05:35.966
at the end of your drinking and using your,

1788
01:05:35.966 --> 01:05:37.503
essentially living outta your car

1789
01:05:37.503 --> 01:05:38.608
and smoking crack essentially-

1790
01:05:38.608 --> 01:05:39.441
Oh, yeah.

1791
01:05:39.441 --> 01:05:40.274
And there's some kind of altercation

1792
01:05:40.274 --> 01:05:41.911
