01:05:50.497 --> 01:05:51.330
It is.
Yeah.

1799
01:05:51.330 --> 01:05:52.163
In Wichita, Kansas,

1800
01:05:52.163 --> 01:05:53.512
which is, I always say, if you can get,

1801
01:05:53.512 --> 01:05:55.191
if you can get sober in Wichita,

1802
01:05:55.191 --> 01:05:56.232
you can get sober anywhere.

1803
01:05:56.232 --> 01:05:57.065
(Charlie laughing)

1804
01:05:57.065 --> 01:05:59.152
No, there was good sobriety there,

1805
01:05:59.152 --> 01:06:02.706
