2374
01:26:44.962 --> 01:26:47.023
and if I can tell a decent story.

2375
01:26:47.023 --> 01:26:47.856
(Charlie laughing)
Right.

2376
01:26:47.856 --> 01:26:48.794
I mean, that's what it should be about, right?

2377
01:26:48.794 --> 01:26:49.627
Yeah.

2378
01:26:49.627 --> 01:26:51.161
If I can tell a decent story,

2379
01:26:51.161 --> 01:26:53.446
I mean, I used to make the joke that I'm,

2380
01:26:53.446 --> 01:26:56.196
I'm even with running the Sahara,

2381
