I'm gonna, it's not even, so-called taking a break,

2563
01:33:38.783 --> 01:33:40.128
it's just gonna do nothing.

2564
01:33:40.128 --> 01:33:41.207
I'm gonna,

2565
01:33:41.207 --> 01:33:45.660
it's time to be married and to work on life actually,

2566
01:33:45.660 --> 01:33:47.772
instead of always working on.

2567
01:33:47.772 --> 01:33:49.640
Doesn't mean I won't be looking forward towards something-

2568
01:33:49.640 --> 01:33:50.655
Right.

2569
01:33:50.655 --> 01:33:51.779
At some point in the future,

2570
01:33:51.779 --> 01:33:54.418
but it's finding that next thing that

2571
01:33:54.418 --> 01:33:57.335
she and I can do together and that,

2572
01:33:58.622 --> 01:34:00.852
we can travel to some great place.

2573
