2575
01:34:03.774 --> 01:34:06.994
and it was the first time I had traveled,

2576
01:34:06.994 --> 01:34:07.839
traveled.

2577
01:34:07.839 --> 01:34:08.672
I was gonna say, out of the country.

2578
01:34:08.672 --> 01:34:09.505
Right.

2579
01:34:09.505 --> 01:34:10.338
Puerto Rico is a gray area-

2580
01:34:10.338 --> 01:34:11.171
Not for running related.

2581
01:34:11.171 --> 01:34:12.004
Exactly.
Yeah.

2582
01:34:12.004 --> 01:34:12.923
In more than 10 years.

2583
01:34:12.923 --> 01:34:13.756
Yeah.

2584
01:34:13.756 --> 01:34:15.082
That I had actually gone somewhere

2585
01:34:15.082 --> 01:34:15.966
if you don't count prison.

2586
01:34:15.966 --> 01:34:16.903
Yeah, I was gonna say,

2587
01:34:16.903 --> 01:34:17.736
well, Beckley-

2588
01:34:17.736 --> 01:34:18.569
Yeah, that was exactly right.

