01:34:20.235 --> 01:34:21.068
So technically you went there to do that, right?

2592
01:34:21.068 --> 01:34:21.901
(Charlie laughing)

2593
01:34:21.901 --> 01:34:22.734
Exactly.

2594
01:34:22.734 --> 01:34:23.592
(Rich laughing)
(Charlie laughing)

2595
01:34:23.592 --> 01:34:25.244
But we had an actual vacation.

2596
01:34:25.244 --> 01:34:26.223
Yeah.

2597
01:34:26.223 --> 01:34:27.712
