01:34:36.115 --> 01:34:36.948
And you did-

2603
01:34:36.948 --> 01:34:37.781
Getting engaged.

2604
01:34:37.781 --> 01:34:39.180
You didn't, you know, dissolve.

2605
01:34:39.180 --> 01:34:41.305
No, I apparently I got through it just fine.

2606
01:34:41.305 --> 01:34:44.305
(Rich laughing)

2607
01:34:44.305 --> 01:34:48.008
It's been a strange and interesting learning curve

2608
01:34:48.008 --> 01:34:49.449
