2613
01:35:01.961 --> 01:35:04.317
I wouldn't even change the last few years.

2614
01:35:04.317 --> 01:35:05.264
Right.

2615
01:35:05.264 --> 01:35:06.628
And the difficulties,

2616
01:35:06.628 --> 01:35:08.989
and you touched on it the second ago,

2617
01:35:08.989 --> 01:35:09.822
being at Beckley,

2618
01:35:09.822 --> 01:35:13.935
I had some of the most satisfying times of my entire life

2619
01:35:13.935 --> 01:35:15.097
while I was in there,

2620
01:35:15.097 --> 01:35:17.514
because there's nothing like,

2621
