3415
02:03:44.909 --> 02:03:46.928
I never had an experience like that in my life.

3416
02:03:46.928 --> 02:03:49.618
I mean, I actually ran the next day after Badwater.

3417
02:03:49.618 --> 02:03:50.451
Right.

3418
02:03:50.451 --> 02:03:51.284
And two days later,

3419
02:03:51.284 --> 02:03:52.503
I ran five miles with no pain.

3420
02:03:52.503 --> 02:03:53.336
Wow.

3421
02:03:53.336 --> 02:03:57.088
And I'd been in the wheelchair before,

3422
02:03:57.088 --> 02:03:59.594
